&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Normal (Web)&quot;&gt;We have a fantastic opportunity for an experienced &lt;strong&gt;Influence Account &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Normal (Web)&quot;&gt;Director&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Normal (Web)&quot;&gt; to join one of our Top 10 accounts, where everyone &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Normal (Web)&quot;&gt;plays to&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Normal (Web)&quot;&gt; their strengths delivering award-winning campaigns.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
